<h2>About the System</h2>
<h3>E-Submission Approval System v1.0</h3>
<p>This web application was developed to streamline the manual submission process for claims and leave requests.</p>
<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>Role-based access control (Employees vs. Management).</li>
    <li>Secure data handling with SQL Database.</li>
    <li>Real-time status updates and filtering.</li>
</ul>